函数\(f(x)=\cos\left(2x+\frac{\pi}{8}\right)\)的最小正周期为\[\beta=\frac{2\pi}{2}=\pi\]由点积条件，\[m=\mathbfa}\cdot\mathbfb}
=\tan\left(\alpha+\frac{\pi}{4}\right)\cos\alpha-2\]所以\(\tan\left(\alpha+\frac{\pi}{4}\right)\cos\alpha=m+2\).

又因为\(0<\alpha<\frac{\pi}{4}\)，有\(\cos\alpha-\sin\alpha>0\)，并且\[\tan\left(\alpha+\frac{\pi}{4}\right)
=\frac{\sin\alpha+\cos\alpha}{\cos\alpha-\sin\alpha}\]由于\(\beta=\pi\)，\(\sin2(\alpha+\beta)=\sin2\alpha\)，从而\[\frac{2\cos^2\alpha+\sin2(\alpha+\beta)}
{\cos\alpha-\sin\alpha}
=\frac{2\cos^2\alpha+2\sin\alpha\cos\alpha}
{\cos\alpha-\sin\alpha}
=2\tan\left(\alpha+\frac{\pi}{4}\right)\cos\alpha
