由\(\xi=8-k\)，得到分布列\(\xi\)&amp;\(0\)&amp;\(1\)&amp;\(2\)&amp;\(3\)&amp;\(4\)&amp;\(5\)&amp;\(6\)\(P\)&amp;\(\frac{7}{28}\)&amp;\(\frac{6}{28}\)&amp;\(\frac{5}{28}\)&amp;\(\frac{4}{28}\)&amp;\(\frac{3}{28}\)&amp;\(\frac{2}{28}\)&amp;\(\frac{1}{28}\)•\[E(\xi)=\frac{0\cdot7+1\cdot6+2\cdot5+3\cdot4+4\cdot3+5\cdot2+6\cdot1}{28}
=\frac{56}{28}=2\]• 因为\(E(\xi)=2\)，所以\[P(\xi\geqslant E(\xi))
=P(\xi\geqslant2)
=\frac{5+4+3+2+1}{28}
=\frac{15}{28}\]

